## [SPEC-FIXTURE]
## Category: Invalid
## Feature: Concurrency Thread Safety (Data Race Prevention)
## Spec Reference: docs/language-spec/concurrency-model.md#3-thread-safety-the-send-and-sync-capabilities
## Violation: Spawning a concurrent background task that captures an unsynchronized mutable reference across thread boundaries.
## Expected Diagnostic: WON-CON-001: Cannot capture mutable reference '&mut counter' across concurrency boundary; requires Send + Sync synchronization (e.g., Arc[Mutex[T]]).

fn increment_in_parallel():
    var counter: i64 = 0

    scope s:
        s.spawn:
            counter += 1    # Reject: Unsynchronized data race on mutable local variable
